{"sha": "640ad163d6fa52c8c654327f710c0b3a28a3cb44e81c3bfd24bc8576aa3577b9", "body": ["\\begin{proof}[部分证明]", "展开 $\\nu = 0$ 分量：$\\sum_i\\partial_i(E_i/c) =", "\\mu_0\\rho c$，即 $\\operatorname{div}\\vect E = \\rho/\\varepsilon_0$", "（利用 $c^2 = 1/\\mu_0\\varepsilon_0$）。$\\nu = 1$ 分量", "包含 $-\\partial_t(E_x/c^2) + (\\partial_yB_z - \\partial_zB_y)", "= \\mu_0 j_x$，即安培–麦克斯韦方程的 $x$ 分量。其余", "分量同理；无源的一对即", "$A^\\mu$ 的交叉二阶导数相等（", "在\\cref{exo:b3:covariant-electromagnetism:3}中验证）。$F^{\\mu\\nu}$", "按（二指标）张量变换——每个指标都像四维矢量——", "这一点在本阶段不加证明地承认；其推论即下一命题。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\section{场如何变换}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[场的变换]\\label{prop:b3:covariant-electromagnetism:transform}", "\\index{场的变换}", "对速度为 $\\vect v = v\\,\\vect e_x$ 的洛伦兹变换，分量", "\\emph{沿}运动方向的分量保持不变，横向分量相互混合，", "\\[", "E'_x = E_x , \\qquad", "E'_y = \\gamma(E_y - vB_z) , \\qquad", "E'_z = \\gamma(E_z + vB_y) ,", "\\]", "\\[", "B'_x = B_x , \\qquad", "B'_y = \\gamma\\Big(B_y + \\frac{v}{c^2}E_z\\Big) , \\qquad", "B'_z = \\gamma\\Big(B_z - \\frac{v}{c^2}E_y\\Big) .", "\\]", "写成紧凑形式，横向于变换方向：$\\vect E' = \\gamma(\\vect E +", "\\vect v\\wedge\\vect B)_\\perp$ 与 $\\vect B' = \\gamma(\\vect B - \\vect", "v\\wedge\\vect E/c^2)_\\perp$。一个参考系中的纯 $\\vect B$，在另一参考系中是 $\\vect", "E$ 与 $\\vect B$ 的组合——场是同一种现象。", "\\end{proposition}", "\\admitted", "", "\\begin{example}[中性导线的磁性]\\label{ex:b3:covariant-electromagnetism:wire}", "一根中性导线通有电流：正离子晶格静止，电子", "漂移。对旁边运动的试探电荷，变换到其参考系：两", "股电荷流\\emph{以不同方式}收缩（它们的速度不同），", "导线获得净线电荷 $\\lambda' =", "-\\gamma vI/c^2$，其径向电场以", "恰好与实验室所称的 $q\\vect v\\wedge\\vect B$ 一样的力拉动电荷。磁性", "就是相对论的二阶项 $v u/c^2$ 在", "$10^{28}$ 个元电荷每米协同作用时的表现：每种效应都极其微小，", "但导线在更高精度上仍是中性的，", "因此那微小的失衡便是全部的故事", "（见\\cref{pb:b3:covariant-electromagnetism:1}）。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, >=Stealth]", "  % lab frame", "  \\begin{scope}", "    \\draw[thick, fill=omExo!10] (-0.2,0) rectangle (5.4,0.75);", "    \\foreach \\x in {0.3,1.3,2.3,3.3,4.3} \\node[omThm] at (\\x,0.52) {$\\oplus$};", "    \\foreach \\x in {0.8,1.8,2.8,3.8,4.8} {\\node[omDef] at (\\x,0.22) {$\\ominus$};", "      \\draw[->, omDef] (\\x+0.16,0.22) -- (\\x+0.42,0.22);}", "    \\fill[omProp] (2.6,-1.15) circle (2.6pt);", "    \\draw[->, omProp, thick] (2.75,-1.15) -- (3.55,-1.15);", "    \\node[anchor=west] at (3.65,-1.15) {$q$，速率 $v$};", "    \\draw[->, very thick] (2.6,-0.95) -- (2.6,-0.35);", "    \\node[anchor=west, font=\\footnotesize] at (2.7,-0.62) {$q\\vect v\\wedge\\vect B$};", "    \\node at (2.6,1.35) {实验室：导线中性，力为磁力};", "  \\end{scope}", "  % charge frame", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=7.8cm]", "    \\draw[thick, fill=omExo!10] (-0.2,0) rectangle (5.4,0.75);", "    \\foreach \\x in {0.25,1.15,2.05,2.95,3.85,4.75} {\\node[omThm] at (\\x,0.52) {$\\oplus$};", "      \\draw[->, omThm] (\\x-0.14,0.72) -- (\\x-0.4,0.72);}", "    \\foreach \\x in {0.7,1.9,3.1,4.3} \\node[omDef] at (\\x,0.22) {$\\ominus$};", "    \\fill[omProp] (2.6,-1.15) circle (2.6pt);", "    \\node[anchor=west] at (2.75,-1.35) {$q$，静止};", "    \\draw[->, very thick] (2.6,-0.95) -- (2.6,-0.35);", "    \\node[anchor=west, font=\\footnotesize] at (2.7,-0.62) {$q\\vect E'$};", "    \\node at (2.6,1.35) {电荷系：导线带电，力为电力};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 同一个力，两种算法。实验室：中性导线的电流", "产生 $\\vect B$，运动电荷受到 $q\\vect v\\wedge\\vect B$。", "电荷系：正离子晶格此时运动并收缩，", "电子（在该系中较慢）分散开；导线带净电荷，其", "$\\vect E'$ 起拉动作用。同一实验，同一结果。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[快速电荷的扁平场]\\label{ex:b3:covariant-electromagnetism:pancake}", "将电荷的库仑场变换到其", "$\\gamma \\gg 1$ 运动的参考系中：纵向场不变，而横向场", "乘以 $\\gamma$。原本球对称的场", "压扁成张角 $\\sim 1/\\gamma$ 的盘状，围绕过电荷的", "平面分布；在垂直于运动的方向上，伴有", "磁环 $B' = vE'/c^2$。对静止观察者而言，", "LHC 质子（$\\gamma \\approx 7000$）的经过是", "亚皮秒量级、由近乎垂直的 $\\vect E$ 与 $\\vect B$ 构成的冲击：几乎", "一束光脉冲——这正是快速束流与物质相互作用", "方式与光子相仿的原因。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, >=Stealth]", "  % static charge", "  \\begin{scope}", "    \\fill[omThm] (0,0) circle (2.6pt);", "    \\foreach \\a in {0,30,...,330} \\draw[->, omDef] (\\a:0.25) -- (\\a:1.75);", "    \\node at (0,-2.5) {静止：各向同性库仑场};", "  \\end{scope}", "  % moving charge", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=8.0cm]", "    \\fill[omThm] (0,0) circle (2.6pt);", "    \\draw[->, very thick] (0.3,-2.1) -- (1.5,-2.1) node[right] {$v \\approx c$};", "    \\foreach \\a/\\l in {90/1.95, 75/1.5, 105/1.5, 60/0.85, 120/0.85,", "                       270/1.95, 255/1.5, 285/1.5, 240/0.85, 300/0.85,", "                       0/0.35, 180/0.35, 30/0.45, 150/0.45, 210/0.45, 330/0.45}", "      \\draw[->, omDef] (\\a:0.25) -- (\\a:\\l);", "    \\node at (0,-2.5) {};", "    \\node at (0.3,-2.65) {};", "    \\node at (0,-2.9) {};", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\node at (8.0,-2.5) {运动：场压扁为 $\\sim 1/\\gamma$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}